    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Marleen Temmerman received the Outstanding Female Scientist Award by the European and Developing Countries Clinical Trials Partnership at a ceremony at the Eighth EDCTP Forum in Lusaka, Zambia, on November 8. Professor Temmerman is Chair of the Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology and Director of the Centre of Excellence in Women and Child Health in the Faculty of Health Sciences at the Aga Khan University in East Africa.",
